---
layout: base.njk
title: Our Work — GullStack Portfolio
description: Before and after. Real businesses. Real transformations. See how we help companies eliminate bloat, improve speed, and convert more customers.
headerStyle: inner
activeNav: portfolio
css: |
  main {
    padding-top: 140px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .portfolio-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }
  .portfolio-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .portfolio-hero p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .portfolio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .portfolio-card {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .portfolio-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  .portfolio-card-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16/10;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
    display: block;
  }

  .portfolio-card-content {
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .portfolio-card-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .portfolio-card-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .portfolio-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .portfolio-stat {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #22c55e;
    background: rgba(34,197,94,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.2);
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .portfolio-card-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cta-section h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .portfolio-hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
    .portfolio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
---

<main class="container">
  <div class="portfolio-hero fade-in">
    <h1>Our Work</h1>
    <p>Before and after. Real businesses. Real transformations.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="portfolio-grid">
    <a href="/portfolio/abc-services/" class="portfolio-card fade-in">
      <img src="/images/abc-side-by-side.jpg" alt="Advanced Building Care — Before and After" class="portfolio-card-image">
      <div class="portfolio-card-content">
        <h3>Advanced Building Care</h3>
        <p>Commercial cleaning company rebuilt from a bloated Wix template to a blazing-fast static site.</p>
        <div class="portfolio-stats">
          <span class="portfolio-stat">96% smaller</span>
          <span class="portfolio-stat">34% faster</span>
          <span class="portfolio-stat">25x lighter</span>
        </div>
        <span class="portfolio-card-link">View full breakdown &#8594;</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Add more portfolio cards here as projects are completed -->
  </div>

  <div class="cta-section fade-in">
    <h3>Want to Be Next?</h3>
    <p>We'll audit your current site for free and show you exactly what's holding it back.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Get Your Free Audit &#8594;</a>
  </div>
</main>